{"4346080": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dr.Ragnam Show", "steam_appid": 4346080, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4346080/extras/5a3635b67f75c5dca12899e8efa3ffa7.avif?t=1769937642\" width=1560 height=229 /></span><strong>Welcome. Cameras are live. There is no escape.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dr. Ragnam is a ruthless doctor running his own twisted reality show.<br>He abducts four monkeys and forces them to survive inside a nightmarish hospital–dungeon, broadcast live for everyone to watch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You and your friends are those monkeys.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And nothing is fair.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4346080/extras/17da93a1e65ff92815200655bddd2cb1.avif?t=1769937642\" width=1560 height=229 /></span>Each player starts the game with a <strong>severe limitation</strong>:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One monkey wears headphones</strong> → Cannot hear anything.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One monkey has a taped mouth</strong> → Cannot speak, but can hear.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One monkey is blindfolded</strong> → Cannot see, but can hear and speak.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One monkey is paralyzed</strong> → Cannot move and must be carried by another player.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive, you must cooperate<br><strong>without full communication.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4346080/extras/b15632d0011562d0bbcb37a5fddd95d2.avif?t=1769937642\" width=1560 height=229 /></span>Dr. Ragnam is always watching.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cameras are everywhere—walls, corridors, rooms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each round, he demands an item:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“Enter my dungeon. Find it. Bring it back.”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the hospital is <strong>alive</strong>.<br>Hallways shift, lights go out, and things start hunting you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And you try to escape…<br>with broken senses.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4346080/extras/e89dc20a9fda9daed1b76902eb0020d5.avif?t=1769937642\" width=1560 height=229 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark and oppressive environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unexpected threats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Absurd yet unsettling objects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A blend of tension and dark humor</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mistake slows the team.<br>Panic turns into disaster.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4346080/extras/0d3151b1dfbc3545d82e2f19b9fe1c62.avif?t=1769937642\" width=1560 height=229 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a solo game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You want to warn your team—but you can’t speak. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You want to listen—but you can’t hear. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You want to see—but you’re blind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Miscommunication is the core mechanic.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And that’s where the chaos begins.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4346080/extras/e0b0d8588d2c63807e7db02dfe74422e.avif?t=1769937642\" width=1560 height=229 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dr. Ragnam smiles.<br>Cameras zoom in.<br>The audience watches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is only one question:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you escape the show alive,</strong><br><br><strong>or be sacrificed for higher ratings?</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4346080/extras/5a3635b67f75c5dca12899e8efa3ffa7.avif?t=1769937642\" width=1560 height=229 /></span><strong>Welcome. Cameras are live. There is no escape.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dr. Ragnam is a ruthless doctor running his own twisted reality show.<br>He abducts four monkeys and forces them to survive inside a nightmarish hospital–dungeon, broadcast live for everyone to watch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You and your friends are those monkeys.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And nothing is fair.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4346080/extras/17da93a1e65ff92815200655bddd2cb1.avif?t=1769937642\" width=1560 height=229 /></span>Each player starts the game with a <strong>severe limitation</strong>:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One monkey wears headphones</strong> → Cannot hear anything.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One monkey has a taped mouth</strong> → Cannot speak, but can hear.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One monkey is blindfolded</strong> → Cannot see, but can hear and speak.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One monkey is paralyzed</strong> → Cannot move and must be carried by another player.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive, you must cooperate<br><strong>without full communication.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_t